  "bodyHash": "5848df02fdbb1bd6",
  "content": "\n\n<h1>ViewPlayer</h1>\n<p><strong>ViewPlayer</strong> 是一款輕量級的 Fabric 模組，讓您可以暫時透過其他玩家的視角觀看世界。</p>\n<p>它非常適合用於伺服器管理、SMP 活動、角色扮演、電影化場景、除錯，或是單純與朋友們惡作劇。透過簡單的指令，您可以讓自己觀看另一位玩家、讓一位玩家觀看另一位玩家、設定自訂持續時間，或隨時取消效果。</p>\n<h2>功能特色</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 <code>/view</code> 觀看其他玩家的視角</li>\n<li>強制一位玩家觀看另一位玩家</li>\n<li>支援自訂持續時間</li>\n<li>取消個別目前的觀看狀態</li>\n<li>一次取消所有目前的觀看狀態</li>\n<li>計時結束後自動恢復玩家正常的攝影機視角</li>\n<li>簡單、輕量且易於使用</li>\n<li>專為 Fabric 伺服器設計</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>指令</h2>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<pre><code>/view &lt;target&gt;</code></pre>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>讓您在預設時間內觀看選定的玩家。</p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<pre><code>/view &lt;viewer&gt; &lt;target&gt;</code></pre>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>讓一位玩家觀看另一位玩家。</p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<pre><code>/view &lt;viewer&gt; &lt;target&gt; &lt;seconds&gt;</code></pre>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>讓一位玩家在自訂時間內觀看另一位玩家。</p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<pre><code>/view cancel &lt;viewer&gt;</code></pre>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>取消單一玩家的觀看效果。</p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<pre><code>/viewall cancel</code></pre>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>取消所有目前生效的觀看效果。</p>\n<h2>注意事項</h2>\n<p>為了讓攝影機效果正常運作，<strong>伺服器</strong>與<strong>客戶端</strong>都必須安裝 ViewPlayer。</p>\n<p>為了獲得最佳效果，觀看者與目標應彼此靠近並處於同一維度，因為 Minecraft 客戶端只能穩定觀看已載入的實體。</p>\n<h2>適用情境</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>SMP 伺服器管理</li>\n<li>管理員工具</li>\n<li>伺服器活動</li>\n<li>電影化場景</li>\n<li>觀戰模式時刻</li>\n<li>好友間的惡作劇</li>\n</ul>\n<p>簡單。實用。輕量。</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
